<title>USA: Cablevision Q4 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Cablevision Q4 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $5.40     loss	 $3.88</p>
<p> Net loss		 134,279     loss	93,317</p>
<p> Revs		     359,524		  290,767</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,838		   24,066</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $18.52     loss	$14.17</p>
<p> Net loss		 459,859     loss     337,707</p>
<p> Revs		   1,315,142	     1,078,060</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,827		   23,826</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 loss reflects the write-off of certain deferred financing costs of $37.8 million. Full year 1995 results reflect a gain on sales of affiliate interests aggregating $36 million.</p>
